To qualify for a federal student loan, you must fill out the Free Application for Federal Student Aid (RiverValleyLoans Login Page). Nearly all students who complete this form will be eligible to get a Federal Student loan, but there are limits on what you can borrow depending on your year in school, and whether you are considered dependent or independent. 
